      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think having these properties defined in `android_device` would lead to variation creation of the partitions. IIUC these properties are either:\n- used to create `build.prop`\n- [propagated](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/make/core/product_config.mk;drc\u003dc4baa3aa7240e1b0cb013f853669aa419e55ee1e;l\u003d391) to the partitions and [used to create `build.prop`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/android14-qpr3-release:build/make/core/sysprop.mk;drc\u003d53dd895407cf3d09c559f31240a1985005d8085d;l\u003d39) -- So in Soong, we would not need to propagate this to the partition modules and let `build_prop` module handle the values.",
